  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p>Taking <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></math> both side</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now differentiating both side w.r.t&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;.......(i)</p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now rewriting&nbsp;equation (i) again we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p>"
  }
}